---
title: "Design System for this website"
description: "The tokens, grid, and components that define the visual language of briananders.com — dark-first, mobile-first, 12-column, and driven by CSS custom properties."
date: 2026-08-28
priority: 0.8
pageClasses:
  - 'design-system'
layout: base
styles:
  - 'main'
  - 'posts/design-system'
scripts:
  - 'posts/design-system'
---

<!-- ==========================================================
     Foundations
     ========================================================== -->
<section id="foundations">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="ds-eyebrow">Foundations · Tokens</div>
    <h2>Foundations</h2>
    <p>
      Every visual value lives as a CSS custom property on
      <code>:root</code> in <code>src/styles/system/_tokens.scss</code>.
      Components read from those tokens rather than hard-coding colours,
      radii, or motion values — that way a change here ripples through
      every page automatically.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Color ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="color">
    <h3>Color</h3>
    <p>Dark-first neutrals for surfaces, an orange ramp inherited from the
      site's existing gradient DNA, and semantic accents. Click any swatch
      to copy its CSS variable name to the clipboard.</p>

    <h4 class="ds-group-label">Neutrals &amp; surfaces</h4>
    <div class="ds-swatch-grid">
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-bg"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-bg); border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-divider)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">bg</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#0B0D10</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-surface-1"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-surface-1)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">surface-1</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#12161C</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-surface-2"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-surface-2)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">surface-2</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#1A2029</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-surface-3"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-surface-3)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">surface-3</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#232B36</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-border"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-border)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">border</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#2A3341</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-text"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-text)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">text</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#F2F5F8</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-text-muted"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-text-muted)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">text-muted</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#A6B0BE</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-text-subtle"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-text-subtle)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">text-subtle</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#6C7784</span></span></button>
    </div>

    <h4 class="ds-group-label">Brand — Primary (orange)</h4>
    <div class="ds-swatch-grid">
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-50"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-50)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-50</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#FFE9D6</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-100"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-100)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-100</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#FFC79B</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-300"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-300)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-300</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#FF9955</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-500"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-500)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-500</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#F97316</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-600"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-600)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-600</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#E85D0F</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-primary-700"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-primary-700)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">primary-700</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#B24408</span></span></button>
    </div>

    <h4 class="ds-group-label">Accents &amp; semantic</h4>
    <div class="ds-swatch-grid">
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-accent-teal"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-accent-teal)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">accent-teal</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#22D3EE</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-accent-lime"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-accent-lime)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">accent-lime</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#A3E635</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-accent-plum"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-accent-plum)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">accent-plum</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#C084FC</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-success"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-success)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">success</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#34D399</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-warning"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-warning)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">warning</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#FBBF24</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-danger"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-danger)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">danger</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#F87171</span></span></button>
      <button class="ds-swatch" data-var="--color-info"><span class="ds-swatch__chip" style="background:var(--color-info)"></span><span class="ds-swatch__meta"><span class="ds-swatch__name">info</span><span class="ds-swatch__value">#60A5FA</span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Type ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="type">
    <h3>Typography</h3>
    <p><strong>Roboto</strong> for UI &amp; headings, <strong>Source Serif Pro</strong> for long-form reading, <strong>JetBrains Mono</strong> for code. The scale is modular (1.200) and steps up at 960px.</p>

    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">display</span><p class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-size:var(--fs-5xl); font-weight:var(--fw-bold); letter-spacing:-.03em;">Bat Lessons.</p></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">h1 · 4xl</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); font-size:var(--fs-4xl);">The quick brown fox</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">h2 · 3xl</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); font-size:var(--fs-3xl);">The quick brown fox</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">h3 · 2xl</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); font-size:var(--fs-2xl);">The quick brown fox</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">h4 · xl</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); font-size:var(--fs-xl);">The quick brown fox</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">body-lg</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:var(--fs-lg);">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">body</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:var(--fs-lg);">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">body-sm</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-serif); font-size:var(--fs-sm); color:var(--color-text-muted);">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">caption</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:var(--fs-xs); color:var(--color-text-muted);">The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog.</span></div>
    <div class="ds-type-row"><span class="ds-type-row__label">overline</span><span class="ds-type-row__sample" style="font-family:var(--font-sans); font-size:var(--fs-2xs); font-weight:var(--fw-semibold); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; color:var(--color-text-muted);">Section label</span></div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Space ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="space">
    <h3>Spacing scale</h3>
    <p>Every space derives from <code>--unit</code> (4px). Never write raw pixel values for padding, margin, or gap.</p>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <% [1,2,3,4,6,8,12,16,20,24].forEach((n) => { %>
        <div class="ds-space-row">
          <span class="ds-space-row__label">--space-<%- n %> · <%- n * 4 %></span>
          <span class="ds-space-row__bar" style="width:<%- n * 4 %>px"></span>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Grid ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="grid">
    <h3>12-column grid · mobile-first</h3>
    <p>4 columns below 600px · 8 columns from 600–959px · 12 columns at 960px+. Column-span utilities follow the same tiers: <code>.col-*</code>, <code>.t-col-*</code>, <code>.d-col-*</code>. Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>G</kbd> anywhere on the site to overlay the live grid.</p>

    <div class="ds-grid-demo">
      <div class="ds-grid">
        <% for (let i = 1; i <= 12; i++) { %>
          <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-2 t-col-2 d-col-1"><%- i %></div>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="ds-caption">Common layouts — resize the window to watch them collapse.</p>

    <div class="ds-grid-demo">
      <div class="ds-grid">
        <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-4 t-col-8 d-col-8">main · d-col-8</div>
        <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-4 t-col-8 d-col-4">side · d-col-4</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ds-grid-demo">
      <div class="ds-grid">
        <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-2 t-col-4 d-col-4">card · 4</div>
        <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-2 t-col-4 d-col-4">card · 4</div>
        <div class="ds-grid-demo__cell col-4 t-col-8 d-col-4">card · 4</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Radii + elevation ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="radii">
    <h3>Radii &amp; elevation</h3>
    <div class="ds-grid">
      <% [['xs', 4], ['sm', 8], ['md', 12], ['lg', 20]].forEach(([n, px]) => { %>
        <div class="col-2 t-col-4 d-col-3">
          <div class="ds-card ds-center">
            <div class="ds-radius-swatch" style="border-radius:var(--radius-<%- n %>)"></div>
            <div class="ds-caption">radius-<%- n %> · <%- px %></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
    <div class="ds-grid" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
      <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-4"><div class="ds-card" style="box-shadow: var(--elev-1);"><div class="ds-overline">elev-1</div><div class="ds-caption">Low resting elevation. Cards.</div></div></div>
      <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-4"><div class="ds-card" style="box-shadow: var(--elev-2);"><div class="ds-overline">elev-2</div><div class="ds-caption">Interactive / raised.</div></div></div>
      <div class="col-4 t-col-8 d-col-4"><div class="ds-card" style="box-shadow: var(--elev-3);"><div class="ds-overline">elev-3</div><div class="ds-caption">Modal, drawer, top-level.</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ---- Motion ---- -->
  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="motion">
    <h3>Motion</h3>
    <p>Four durations, one standard easing (and one emphasized for arrows / expand). Interactions use <code>--dur-2</code>. Layout transitions use <code>--dur-3</code> or <code>--dur-4</code>. Everything respects <code>prefers-reduced-motion</code>.</p>
    <div class="ds-grid">
      <div class="col-2 t-col-2 d-col-3 ds-card ds-center"><div class="ds-overline">dur-1</div><div class="ds-mono">120ms</div><div class="ds-caption">Micro-feedback</div></div>
      <div class="col-2 t-col-2 d-col-3 ds-card ds-center"><div class="ds-overline">dur-2</div><div class="ds-mono">200ms</div><div class="ds-caption">Buttons, links, hover</div></div>
      <div class="col-2 t-col-2 d-col-3 ds-card ds-center"><div class="ds-overline">dur-3</div><div class="ds-mono">320ms</div><div class="ds-caption">Panels, tabs</div></div>
      <div class="col-2 t-col-2 d-col-3 ds-card ds-center"><div class="ds-overline">dur-4</div><div class="ds-mono">480ms</div><div class="ds-caption">Modal, page-level</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ==========================================================
     Components
     ========================================================== -->
<section id="components">
  <div class="content">
    <div class="ds-eyebrow">Components · Library</div>
    <h2>Components</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="buttons">
    <h3>Buttons</h3>
    <p>Minimum 44px tap target. Primary is orange with a soft glow; secondary is a bordered surface; ghost is chromeless.</p>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <div class="ds-cluster">
        <button class="button-link primary">Primary</button>
        <button class="button-link">Secondary</button>
        <button class="button-link ghost">Ghost</button>
        <button class="button-link" disabled>Disabled</button>
      </div>
      <div class="ds-cluster" style="margin-top: var(--space-4);">
        <button class="button-link primary mega-button">Mega button</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h4 style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">Play / Pause / PlayPause icons</h4>
    <p>Add <code>.play</code>, <code>.pause</code>, or <code>.playpause</code> to any button to prefix it with a unicode media-control glyph. Use them for start/pause/toggle actions across post experiments.</p>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <div class="ds-cluster">
        <button class="button play"      type="button">Play</button>
        <button class="button pause"     type="button">Pause</button>
        <button class="button playpause" type="button">Play&nbsp;/&nbsp;Pause</button>
        <button class="button primary play" type="button">Start</button>
      </div>
      <p class="ds-caption" style="margin-top: var(--space-3);">The icon-only variant drops the text label. Toggle between <code>.play</code> and <code>.pause</code> in your JS to reflect the current state.</p>
      <div class="ds-cluster">
        <button class="button play-pause play"      type="button" aria-label="Play"></button>
        <button class="button play-pause pause"     type="button" aria-label="Pause"></button>
        <button class="button play-pause playpause" type="button" aria-label="Play/pause"></button>
      </div>
    </div>
<pre class="ds-code-block"><code>&lt;!-- Text + icon --&gt;
&lt;button class="button play"&gt;Start&lt;/button&gt;
&lt;button class="button pause"&gt;Pause&lt;/button&gt;

&lt;!-- Icon-only --&gt;
&lt;button class="button play-pause play" aria-label="Play/pause"&gt;&lt;/button&gt;

// JS: swap classes when state changes
btn.classList.toggle('play',  !isPlaying);
btn.classList.toggle('pause',  isPlaying);</code></pre>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="column-widths">
    <h3>Column-width tokens</h3>
    <p>Every column at the desktop tier is 80px wide with 16px gaps. That gives a set of derived max-widths — <code>--max-1-column</code> through <code>--max-12-columns</code> — for capping a card or list to an integer number of grid columns:</p>
<pre class="ds-code-block"><code>.recommended-list {
  max-width: var(--max-8-columns);   /* 752px */
}</code></pre>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <% [1,2,3,4,6,8,10,12].forEach((n) => { %>
        <div class="ds-space-row">
          <span class="ds-space-row__label">--max-<%- n %>-column<%- n === 1 ? '' : 's' %></span>
          <span class="ds-space-row__bar" style="width: calc(<%- n %> * var(--col-width) + <%- n - 1 %> * var(--col-gap))"></span>
        </div>
      <% }); %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="links">
    <h3>Links</h3>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <p>An <a href="#" class="inline-link">inline link</a> inside a paragraph. It's teal, underlined subtly, and brightens on hover.</p>
      <a href="#" class="block-link">Read the full post <b>&gt;</b></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="forms">
    <h3>Forms</h3>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <div class="ds-grid">
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <label for="ds-name">Full name</label>
          <input id="ds-name" type="text" placeholder="Brian Anders" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <label for="ds-topic">Topic</label>
          <select id="ds-topic">
            <option>Drums</option>
            <option>Podcasts</option>
            <option>Code experiments</option>
            <option>Something else</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <label for="ds-vol">Snare volume</label>
          <input id="ds-vol" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="72" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <label for="ds-count">Count</label>
          <input id="ds-count" type="number" min="0" max="16" value="4" />
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-8 d-col-12">
          <label for="ds-msg">Message</label>
          <textarea id="ds-msg" placeholder="Say hi…"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <div class="ds-cluster">
            <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="checkbox" checked> Subscribe to posts</label>
            <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="checkbox"> DM me</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-6">
          <div class="ds-cluster">
            <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="radio" name="ds-pref" checked> Weekly</label>
            <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="radio" name="ds-pref"> Monthly</label>
            <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="radio" name="ds-pref"> Never</label>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-4 t-col-8 d-col-12">
          <label class="ds-inline-check"><input type="checkbox" class="toggle" checked> Enable dark mode <span class="ds-caption">(it's always on — this is a demo)</span></label>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="cards">
    <h3>Cards</h3>
    <div class="ds-grid">
      <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-4">
        <div class="ds-card">
          <div class="ds-eyebrow">Post · 2026</div>
          <h4>Cellular automaton in canvas</h4>
          <p class="ds-body-muted">A generative pattern that walks a grid, colouring pixels based on neighbourhood rules.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-4 t-col-4 d-col-4">
        <a href="#" class="ds-card ds-card--interactive">
          <div class="ds-eyebrow">Contribution</div>
          <h4>Banders Drums →</h4>
          <p class="ds-body-muted">A YouTube channel with videos of me playing drum covers.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="col-4 t-col-8 d-col-4">
        <div class="ds-card ds-card--elevated">
          <div class="ds-eyebrow">Feature</div>
          <h4>Elevated variant</h4>
          <p class="ds-body-muted">Editorial callouts, "new" cards, or above-the-fold highlights.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="badges">
    <h3>Badges &amp; pills</h3>
    <div class="ds-card">
      <div class="ds-cluster">
        <span class="ds-badge">Default</span>
        <span class="ds-badge ds-badge--primary"><span class="ds-badge__dot"></span>Primary</span>
        <span class="ds-badge ds-badge--success"><span class="ds-badge__dot"></span>Live</span>
        <span class="ds-badge ds-badge--warning"><span class="ds-badge__dot"></span>Draft</span>
        <span class="ds-badge ds-badge--danger"><span class="ds-badge__dot"></span>Broken</span>
        <span class="ds-badge ds-badge--info"><span class="ds-badge__dot"></span>Info</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content ds-subsection" id="alerts">
    <h3>Alerts</h3>
    <div class="ds-stack">
      <div class="ds-alert ds-alert--info">   <span class="ds-alert__icon">ℹ️</span><div><p class="ds-alert__title">Heads up</p><p class="ds-alert__body">This is a neutral information message.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ds-alert ds-alert--success"><span class="ds-alert__icon">✅</span><div><p class="ds-alert__title">Build passed</p><p class="ds-alert__body">All 42 tests green in 4.1s.</p></div></div>
      <div class="ds-alert ds-alert--warning"><span class="ds-alert__icon">⚠️</span><div><p class="ds-alert__title">Almost out of budget</p><p class="ds-alert__body">Page weight is at 92% of its budget.</p></div></div>
